A tiny world to prove the Dialog toolchain works.

Living room
A cozy room. A hallway leads north.

> look
Living room
A cozy room. A hallway leads north.

> open chest
The treasure chest is locked.

> n
You walk north.

Hallway
A bare hallway. The living room is south.

> take key
You take the silver key.

> open cursed chest
(first attempting to unlock the cursed chest with the silver key)
You unlock the cursed chest with the silver key.

The chest radiates malice and will not budge.

> unlock cursed chest with silver key
The cursed chest is already unlocked.

> open cursed chest
The chest radiates malice and will not budge.

> s
You walk south.

Living room
A cozy room. A hallway leads north.

> open chest
(first attempting to unlock the treasure chest with the silver key)
You unlock the treasure chest with the silver key.

You open the treasure chest, revealing a gold coin.

> take coin
You take the gold coin out of the treasure chest.

> inventory
You have a gold coin and a silver key.
